/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (So basically, territory owners and stackers that get a piece of the daily rewards are getting paid for each boost. A boost that sits unchallenged is therefore an accepted advertisement: "We accept your sats, have your stage".)
/Pg 12 0 R
