196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (As long as my premise holds, when a shitcoiner posts a story about their new thing, or a scammer posts a new product that rugs its users, and boosts it, it too is an ad. Sold to the scammer/shitcoiner by the people that received the boost sats, and therefore, these stackers profit from the scam/shitcoin.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (If a territory owner disagrees with the scam being promoted on their territory, then they can, at no additional cost, downzap the post for that 70%. These sats will then go 100% to rewards, making the remainder of undoing the boost, if they feel so inclined, sit in the hands of the stackers that will receive the payout. At this point, 100% of the boost will be paid out to stackers in the next rewards payout, and the scammer can be 100% neutralized, only if 30% of the stackers are in agreement that the scam should not be promoted. So stackers as a whole have the upper hand here.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
