324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Recently, I noticed my current SIM card subscription is about to expire, so I checked how much the new subscription will cost. The SIM provider has jacked up the price over the years in the name of giving you MORE internet data, which I barely use. I don't really need 50 GB each month or 2000 mins for calls. It's really important to know what you actually need, because the fiat world loves to package things you don't need. So I was thinking maybe switch to prepaid, pay-as-I-go, and I had to call the call center three times to get it done. Only after going through things like this do you really appreciate how much better the experience is with Bitcoin e-SIM services.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
